WindVim
Copyright 2026 tingfeng347

WindVim is a customized Neovim configuration based on LazyVim and the
LazyVim starter template. It is an independent community configuration.

LazyVim: https://github.com/LazyVim/LazyVim
LazyVim documentation: https://www.lazyvim.org/
LazyVim starter: https://github.com/LazyVim/starter

The starter's Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE. WindVim additions
and modifications are distributed under the same license. Dependencies
remain under their respective licenses; they are installed separately.

WindVim additions include the local optional Chinese UI translation plugin,
WindVim dashboard, terminal and Sidekick layouts, and visual customizations.
The configuration's Git history was extracted from tingfeng347/dotfiles.
